{"id":"degrau","lemma":"degrau","pos":"noun","rank":4701,"glosses":["step (of a staircase) or rung (of a ladder)","step (a distinct part of a progression)"],"ipa":"/dɨˈɡɾaw/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"degraus"},"examples":[{"text":"Cuidado com o degrau.","en":"Watch your step.","words":[{"g":"watch out!"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Não sente nos degraus.","en":"Don't sit on the steps.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"us","l":"nós"},null]},{"text":"Esta escada tem quantos degraus?","en":"How many steps does this staircase have?","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"ladder"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"how many"},null]},{"text":"Tom não estava sentado nos degraus.","en":"Tom wasn't sitting on the steps.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"seated"},{"g":"us","l":"nós"},null]},{"text":"Ele subiu os degraus lentamente.","en":"He went up the steps slowly.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to ascend, to go up","l":"subir"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"slowly"}]}]}